	(text "For Flashing (Device Mode): The CM4 ignores this pin when nRPIBOOT is active, but keeping it floating is the \"safe default\" for device mode.\n\nFor Cameras (Host Mode): force the CM4 to be a Host using software. Add this line to config.txt file after flashing the OS:\ndtoverlay=dwc2,dr_mode=host"
